# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output. Everything here is regenerated from source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build
artifacts/
*.d
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe
*.out
*.gch
*.pch
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# `*.app` also matches the WinUI project directory PicoSwitch.Companion.App;
# companions/windows/.gitignore re-includes it.
*.app

# C++/WinRT projection output: native projects generate headers beside their
# sources; only the IDL and hand-written implementation belong in Git.
**/Generated Files/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials. External by construction and never committed. The Windows
# build reads signing.properties or the equivalent environment variables and
# produces an UNSIGNED package when neither resolves.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
companions/windows/signing.properties
*.pfx
*.snk
*.keystore
*.jks
*.appinstaller
key_retail.bin

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release artifacts, rebuilt on demand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
companions/windows/PicoSwitch2-Companion-*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local evidence and lab output. Indexed, not versioned: see
# docs/lab-evidence-index.md. Captures a test replays are promoted to
# tests/fixtures/captures/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lab-tool output (tools/*_lab.ps1, read_uart_diag.ps1, ...). Android
# bugreports in particular carry account addresses and Wi-Fi SSIDs.
/dumps/
# Large captures and recordings; must survive a build/ wipe, so never in build/.
/lab-evidence/
/usbpcaptures/
# Independently versioned reference clones.
/nso-gc-refs/

# Generated amiibo test images (tools/generate_test_amiibo.py).
amiibo-*-test.bin
# Optional AmiiboAPI download for tests/tools/test_amiibo_games.mjs (~1.2 MB).
tests/fixtures/amiibo-showgames.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local working notes: task prompts and session scratch. Durable guidance
# belongs in docs/ or AGENTS.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*_PASS.md
/DOUBLE_TAP*.md
/ANALOG_TRIGGER.md
